        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2505]\nUpon reception of SECP521_EncryptedPrivateKey, the receiver (EVCC) shall decrypt the contract certificate private key using the session key derived in the ECDHE protocol (see 7.9.2.5.4) and applying the algorithm AES-GCM-256 according to NIST Special Publication 800-38D. The IV shall be read from the 12 most significant bytes of the SECP521_EncryptedPrivateKey field. The ciphertext (encrypted private key) shall be read from the 66 bytes after the IV in the SECP521_EncryptedPrivateKey field. The AAD for this decryption shall be calculated before decryption following [V2G20-2492] and [V2G20-2494]. The authentication tag shall be read from the 16 least significant bytes of the SECP521_EncryptedPrivateKey field.",
            "block_bbox": [
                69,
                167,
                218,
                195
